# Everything that runs on a user's machine or with this repository's credentials without a human
# reading it first: the plugin and its hooks, the skills an agent follows as instructions, the
# instructions agents read on entry, and the workflows that build and publish. A change to any of
# these needs a maintainer's review, which takes effect once the master ruleset requires
# code-owner review.
#
# There is one maintainer today. Add a second owner per path before relying on this for review
# independence: CODEOWNERS cannot make an author approve their own change.

